  "ruleText": "He-P 2150.01 Declaration of Purpose. RSA 143:20-28 requires the New Hampshire department of health and human services to ensure the safety of shellfish being sold for food within the state of New Hampshire.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at part heading for He-P 2150) #10704, eff 10-23-14; ss by #13569, eff 2-25-23",
